OL,3,ASir Tom Jones mentors Cardiff singer to
OL,4,Avictory on The Voice UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA singer who began her career as a
OL,7,Fteenager busking on the streets of
OL,8,FCardiff has been crowned winner of The
OL,9,FVoice UK.
OL,11,FCate McHugh, from Llantwit Major in the
OL,12,FVale of Glamorgan, appeared stunned
OL,13,Fwhen she heard her name announced on
OL,14,Fthe ITV show, telling viewers "I did
OL,15,Fit" when asked how she was feeling.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
