OL,3,ASir Tom Jones mentors Cardiff singer to
OL,4,Avictory on The Voice UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe performer, who has a degenerative
OL,7,Fsight condition which has left her
OL,8,Fregistered blind, was given a
OL,9,Fcongratulatory hug by her coach Sir Tom
OL,10,FJones on his final appearance on the
OL,11,Fshow after previously announcing he had
OL,12,Fbeen "fired".
OL,14,FSpeaking after the show, McHugh, 31,
OL,15,Fsaid: "I won The Voice! I'm entirely
OL,16,Fgobsmacked and absolutely haven't fully
OL,17,Fprocessed this information just yet."
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
